<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TEST 1 TRẮC NGHIỆM CẤP TRƯỜNG KHỐI 5</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0275d8;
            --success-color: #28a745;
            --danger-color: #dc3545;
            --background-color: #f4f6f9;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--background-color);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--primary-color);
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .quiz-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
        }
        .question-box {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary-color);
        }
        .question-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .question-img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: block;
            max-height: 200px;
        }
        .options {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .option-label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .option-label:hover {
            background: #e9ecef;
            border-color: #b5bbc1;
        }
        .option-label input {
            margin-right: 12px;
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }
        .fill-blank-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .fill-blank-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(2, 117, 216, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-submit {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .btn-submit:hover {
            background: #01549b;
        }
        #result-box {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .success {
            background: #d4edda;
            color: #155724;
            border: 1px solid #c3e6cb;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>TEST 1 TRẮC NGHIỆM CẤP TRƯỜNG KHỐI 5</h1>
        <div class="quiz-info">
            <span>Môn: Tiếng Anh IOE</span>
            <span id="timer">Thời gian: 20:00</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <form id="quiz-form">
        <!-- Câu 2 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 1. She t_ _ _ lots of photos at the food festival yesterday. (Điền từ còn thiếu)</div>
            <input type="text" class="fill-blank-input" id="q2" placeholder="Nhập từ tiếng Anh đầy đủ...">
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 3 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 2. How often do you visit your grandparents? - Once a w_ _ _. (Điền từ còn thiếu)</div>
            <input type="text" class="fill-blank-input" id="q3" placeholder="Nhập từ tiếng Anh đầy đủ...">
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 4 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 3. The city is crowded ___ busy.</div>
            <div class="options">
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="A"> A. or</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="B"> B. but</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="C"> C. with</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q4" value="D"> D. and</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 6 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 4. Write a question for the underlined part: <u>My house is big and new.</u> I love it.</div>
            <div class="options">
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="A"> A. Who do you live with?</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="B"> B. Where are you living now?</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="C"> C. What's your house like?</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q6" value="D"> D. What's your address?</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 8 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 5. Where _ _ Ba and Hung live? (Điền từ còn thiếu)</div>
            <input type="text" class="fill-blank-input" id="q8" placeholder="Nhập 2 chữ cái...">
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 9 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 6. My favourite food is _____.</div>
            <img src="https://unsplash.com" class="question-img" alt="Chicken">
            <div class="options">
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="A"> A. pork</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="B"> B. fish</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="C"> C. beef</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q9" value="D"> D. chicken</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 10 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 7. She al_ _ _ _ _ finishes her homework before going to bed. (Điền từ còn thiếu)</div>
            <input type="text" class="fill-blank-input" id="q10" placeholder="Nhập từ hoàn chỉnh...">
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 13 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 8. Is this your desk? – ....</div>
            <div class="options">
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q13" value="A"> A. No. That desk is my</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q13" value="B"> B. No. That my desk is</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q13" value="C"> C. No. That desk my</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q13" value="D"> D. No. That's my desk</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 19 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 9. Tony flies back to Australia. Which kind of transportation does he use?</div>
            <div class="options">
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q19" value="A"> A. Car</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q19" value="B"> B. Underground</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q19" value="C"> C. Train</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q19" value="D"> D. Plane</label>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Câu 20 -->
        <div class="question-box">
            <div class="question-text">Câu 10. Put the adverb in the brackets into the correct place: They go to the cinema on weekends. (often)</div>
            <div class="options">
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q20" value="A"> A. They go to the often cinema on weekends.</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q20" value="B"> B. They go often to the cinema on weekends.</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q20" value="C"> C. Often they go to the cinema on weekends.</label>
                <label class="option-label"><input type="radio" name="q20" value="D"> D. They often go to the cinema on weekends.</label>
            </div>
        </div>
